{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399440/extras/8a6b37e3f44c5390229326cbb51735cc.avif?t=1749283338\" width=630 height=172 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399440/extras/938bf5f66e713c7b40cd81025ba36677.avif?t=1749283338\" width=700 height=95 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Summary</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your ranch has been burnt down, but there are traces of the perpetrator &quot;EquinoCorp&quot; at the scene! You set off into the city to investigate the mystery behind its destruction, and to get revenge while somewhat helping out others along the way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A single-player narrative game where you play as a quirky wannabe cowboy exploring the dystopian futuristic world for his own revenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399440/extras/b0ac9937c906b50b3677a902dc9b3790.poster.avif?t=1749283338\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399440/extras/b0ac9937c906b50b3677a902dc9b3790.webm?t=1749283338\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399440/extras/938bf5f66e713c7b40cd81025ba36677.avif?t=1749283338\" width=700 height=95 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A Linear Story with Branching Narrative Choices</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Wonderful Cast of Characters (including yourself as the titular Cowboy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Interrogating suspects and chasing leads</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A variety of mini-games to shake up the pace</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Animated cutscenes for every level</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399440/extras/938bf5f66e713c7b40cd81025ba36677.avif?t=1749283338\" width=700 height=95 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399440/extras/f3e1f1eaa0585293ad8d076b6897df46.avif?t=1749283338\" width=630 height=172 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Explosive Temper","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3399440/e825e20bc697b0f7334f52b5c07e7418df26b0d1.jpg"},{"name":"Just Snoozin'","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3399440/5072597c158c0a80a94c76c75fa35801cd9f68fa.jpg"},{"name":"The Murderer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3399440/3c44a1fbfc411934ab9483bc27b0145ddc6284e5.jpg"},{"name":"Zero Empathy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3399440/a39a9152d1cbe1dca0806eddd5d9f64cd89e9599.jpg"},{"name":"Sewer Speedrun","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3399440/22fa353f6d0ac1763a40821c4e57b1f3787a3d8f.jpg"},{"name":"Exterminator","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3399440/eb3d1414e0d6dbf08bc37d72254603fb1cfafaad.jpg"},{"name":"Smart Cookie","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3399440/913e964e5c7df163367a4337d0acf7b000af07d6.jpg"},{"name":"The Traitor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.s